_ready(); print('jit grad run', time.time()-t0)\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"bits attempt 010101 21\ntc neel idx 21\nnorm 1.0\nneel energy density -0.6666667\nloss -0.6243321 time 1.9918303489685059\ngrad shapes [(2,), (2,), (2,), (2, 6, 3)] time 6.887110710144043\njit loss compile 1.3654170036315918\njit loss run 0.0003387928009033203\njit grad compile 6.578520774841309\njit grad run 0.0012478828430175781\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
